{{crash}}{{/kræʃ}}{{v./n. 碰撞；坠毁；崩溃}}{{The plane crashed into the mountain due to engine failure.}}
{{create}}{{/kriˈeɪt}}{{v. 创造；创建}}{{The artist created a beautiful sculpture.}}
{{creature}}{{/ˈkriːtʃər}}{{n. 生物；动物}}{{The ocean is home to many strange creatures.}}
{{credit}}{{/ˈkredɪt}}{{n./v. 信用；学分；归功于}}{{She deserves credit for the success of the project.}}
{{crew}}{{/kruː}}{{n. 全体船员；一组工作人员}}{{The film crew worked tirelessly to finish the movie.}}
{{crime}}{{/kraɪm}}{{n. 犯罪；罪行}}{{Crime rates have decreased in recent years.}}
{{crisis}}{{/ˈkraɪsɪs}}{{n. 危机；紧要关头}}{{The financial crisis affected economies worldwide.}}
{{critical}}{{/ˈkrɪtɪkl}}{{adj. 批评的；关键的；危急的}}{{Critical thinking is an important skill for students.}}
{{criticism}}{{/ˈkrɪtɪsɪzəm}}{{n. 批评；评论}}{{The policy faced criticism from various groups.}}
{{crop}}{{/krɒp}}{{n. 庄稼；收成}}{{The farmers harvested a good crop this year.}}
{{cross}}{{/krɒs}}{{v./n. 穿过；十字架}}{{Be careful when you cross the street.}}
{{crowd}}{{/kraʊd}}{{n./v. 人群；拥挤}}{{A large crowd gathered in the square to celebrate.}}
{{crucial}}{{/ˈkruːʃl}}{{adj. 至关重要的；决定性的}}{{Education is crucial for the development of a country.}}
{{cruel}}{{/ˈkruːəl}}{{adj. 残忍的；残酷的}}{{It is cruel to keep animals in tiny cages.}}
{{crush}}{{/krʌʃ}}{{v./n. 压碎；镇压}}{{The machine can crush rocks into small pieces.}}
{{cultivate}}{{/ˈkʌltɪveɪt}}{{v. 培养；耕种}}{{Schools should cultivate students' creativity.}}
{{cultural}}{{/ˈkʌltʃərəl}}{{adj. 文化的}}{{The city has a rich cultural heritage.}}
{{cure}}{{/kjʊər}}{{n./v. 治愈；疗法}}{{Scientists are working hard to find a cure for cancer.}}
{{curious}}{{/ˈkjʊəriəs}}{{adj. 好奇的；奇怪的}}{{Children are naturally curious about the world.}}
{{current}}{{/ˈkʌrənt}}{{adj./n. 当前的；水流；电流}}{{The current economic situation is unstable.}}
{{curriculum}}{{/kəˈrɪkjələm}}{{n. 课程；课程表}}{{The school updated its curriculum to include coding classes.}}
{{custom}}{{/ˈkʌstəm}}{{n. 习惯；风俗；海关}}{{It is a custom to give red envelopes during Chinese New Year.}}
{{customer}}{{/ˈkʌstəmər}}{{n. 顾客；客户}}{{The store offers discounts to regular customers.}}
{{cycle}}{{/ˈsaɪkl}}{{n./v. 循环；骑自行车}}{{The water cycle is essential for life on Earth.}}
